    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5c654901b786c6c593bd011163c83586.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5c654901b786c6c593bd011163c83586.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Your fate hangs in the balance as The Stranger, a condemned criminal chosen by the All-Father himself. Preserve this tired world or destroy it, and the choice is yours.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/d7ed7e7265fe5b316d9d0e77af30c2f2.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/d7ed7e7265fe5b316d9d0e77af30c2f2.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The hopeless, the lost, the drowned and forgotten, all must obey one rule: fight to survive. Generations of unwanted criminals and degenerates lurk in the dark corners of the Necrovale.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/ee938c4370cd4c4f55bd6dcf1a727def.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/ee938c4370cd4c4f55bd6dcf1a727def.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The Necrovale is filled with powerful relics left behind by those whose story ended in the depths. Collect these weapons, armor, shields, staffs, jewelry, totems, hats, books, and other tchotchkes as you follow in their footsteps.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5774852fbf3e2cd453e2013a9786c7a0.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5774852fbf3e2cd453e2013a9786c7a0.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Along your journey, you will meet other prisoners. The crimes and failures that brought them to the Necrovale are their own business. Reserve your judgement, however, as you might find yourself depending on these strange and broken creatures to survive. <br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5c654901b786c6c593bd011163c83586.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5c654901b786c6c593bd011163c83586.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Your fate hangs in the balance as The Stranger, a condemned criminal chosen by the All-Father himself. Preserve this tired world or destroy it, and the choice is yours.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/d7ed7e7265fe5b316d9d0e77af30c2f2.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/d7ed7e7265fe5b316d9d0e77af30c2f2.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The hopeless, the lost, the drowned and forgotten, all must obey one rule: fight to survive. Generations of unwanted criminals and degenerates lurk in the dark corners of the Necrovale.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/ee938c4370cd4c4f55bd6dcf1a727def.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/ee938c4370cd4c4f55bd6dcf1a727def.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>The Necrovale is filled with powerful relics left behind by those whose story ended in the depths. Collect these weapons, armor, shields, staffs, jewelry, totems, hats, books, and other tchotchkes as you follow in their footsteps.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5774852fbf3e2cd453e2013a9786c7a0.poster.avif?t=1751148942\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717090/extras/5774852fbf3e2cd453e2013a9786c7a0.webm?t=1751148942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Along your journey, you will meet other prisoners. The crimes and failures that brought them to the Necrovale are their own business. Reserve your judgement, however, as you might find yourself depending on these strange and broken creatures to survive. <br><br>",
    "short_description": "Into the Necrovale is an Action RPG in which you collect powerful items that interact with one another. You must be clever with your build if you hope to pierce the mysteries and dangers of the Necrovale, where a thousand generations of miscreants and criminals have been banished.",
